"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg> Admin Panel</button></a></div></div></section><div class=\"pb-trust-strip\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-around flex-wrap gap-3\"><div class=\"item\"><span class=\"text-gold\">🔒</span><span>Secure Payments</span></div><div class=\"item\"><span class=\"text-gold\">⚡</span><span>Instant Delivery</span></div><div class=\"item\"><span class=\"text-gold\">✓</span><span>Verified Products</span></div><div class=\"item\"><span class=\"text-gold\">📞</span><span>24/7 Support</span></div><div class=\"item\"><span class=\"text-gold\">↩</span><span>7-Day Guarantee</span></div></div></div></div><section class=\"py-16 px-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-navy\">Three Applications. One Backend.</h2><p class=\"text-slate-500\">Shared database, shared API, shared customers — no silos.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><a class=\"block\" href=\"/storefront\"><div class=\"pb-card p-6 h-full hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-cloud flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-bag w-6 h-6 text-navy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"></path><path d=\"M3.103 6.034h17.794\"></path><path d=\"M3.4 5.467a2 2 0 0 0-.4 1.2V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6.667a2 2 0 0 0-.4-1.2l-2-2.667A2 2 0 0 0 17 2H7a2 2 0 0 0-1.6.8z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-navy\">Storefront</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono\">/storefront</p></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4\">Digital marketplace with <!-- -->0<!-- --> products across <!-- -->0<!-- --> categories. Streaming, subscriptions, gift cards, gaming, software, and smart projectors. Cart, checkout, instant digital delivery.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-navy text-sm font-semibold\">Browse catalog <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div></a><a class=\"block\" href=\"/crm\"><div class=\"pb-card p-6 h-full hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-cloud flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone-call w-6 h-6 text-navy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 2a9 9 0 0 1 9 9\"></path><path d=\"M13 6a5 5 0 0 1 5 5\"></path><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-navy\">CRM</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono\">/crm</p></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4\">Employee communication center. WhatsApp Business Cloud API, phone dialer, call management, lead tracking, tasks, follow-ups, customer timelines, Meta CAPI integration.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-navy text-sm font-semibold\">Open workspace <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div></a><a class=\"block\" href=\"/admin\"><div class=\"pb-card p-6 h-full hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-cloud flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column w-6 h-6 text-navy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-navy\">Admin</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono\">/admin</p></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4\">Super Admin control center. Manage products, orders, customers, licenses, payments, employees, campaigns, analytics, and system settings — all connected to the same backend.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-navy text-sm font-semibold\">Manage platform <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div></a></div></section><section class=\"py-16 px-4 bg-cloud\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2 text-navy\">Unified Architecture</h2><p class=\"text-slate-500\">Every customer interaction flows through one shared backend</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"><div class=\"pb-card p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle w-5 h-5 text-navy mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z\"></path></svg><div class=\"font-medium text-sm text-navy\">WhatsApp</div><div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\">Official Cloud API with webhook signature verification</div></div><div class=\"pb-card p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone w-5 h-5 text-navy mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><div class=\"font-medium text-sm text-navy\">Phone Dialer</div><div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\">Browser-based dialer with Twilio/Vonage adapter</div></div><div class=\"pb-card p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-megaphone w-5 h-5 text-navy mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 6a13 13 0 0 0 8.4-2.8A1 1 0 0 1 21 4v12a1 1 0 0 1-1.6.8A13 13 0 0 0 11 14H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M6 14a12 12 0 0 0 2.4 7.2 2 2 0 0 0 3.2-2.4A8 8 0 0 1 10 14\"></path><path d=\"M8 6v8\"></path></svg><div class=\"font-medium text-sm text-navy\">Meta CAPI</div><div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\">Fire all 17 standard events for ad attribution</div></div><div class=\"pb-card p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-5 h-5 text-navy mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><div class=\"font-medium text-sm text-navy\">RBAC</div><div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\">Customer, Employee, Manager, Super Admin roles</div></div><div class=\"pb-card p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-5 h-5 text-navy mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><div class=\"font-medium text-sm text-navy\">Shared CRM</div><div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\">Customers sync across storefront, CRM, and admin</div></div><div class=\"pb-card p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-square-check-big w-5 h-5 text-navy mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 10.656V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12.344\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><div class=\"font-medium text-sm text-navy\">Tasks &amp; Follow-ups</div><div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\">Action items tied to customer records</div></div><div class=\"pb-card p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" st